.com/passage/?search=Judges%2013%3A3-5&version=KJV"],["I killed a young lion with my bare hands.","Judges 14:5-6","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%2014%3A5-6&version=KJV"],["I carried away the gates of Gaza.","Judges 16:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%2016%3A3&version=KJV"],["Delilah found out the secret of my strength.","Judges 16:17-19","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%2016%3A17-19&version=KJV"],["My strength was connected to my long hair.","Judges 16:17","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%2016%3A17&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Gideon","c":[["I was threshing wheat by the winepress when an angel came.","Judges 6:11","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%206%3A11&version=KJV"],["I asked God for a sign with a fleece of wool.","Judges 6:36-40","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%206%3A36-40&version=KJV"],["God told me my army was too big.","Judges 7:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%207%3A2&version=KJV"],["My 300 men had trumpets, pitchers and lamps.","Judges 7:16","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%207%3A16&version=KJV"],["The angel called me \"thou mighty man of valour\".","Judges 6:12","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Judges%206%3A12&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Esther","c":[["My cousin Mordecai raised me.","Esther 2:7","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Esther%202%3A7&version=KJV"],["I was chosen out of many young women to be queen.","Esther 2:17","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Esther%202%3A17&version=KJV"],["I asked all the Jews in Shushan to fast for three days.","Esther 4:16","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Esther%204%3A16&version=KJV"],["I said, \"If I perish, I perish.\"","Esther 4:16","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Esther%204%3A16&version=KJV"],["I saved my people from Haman’s plot.","Esther 7:3-6","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Esther%207%3A3-6&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Ruth","c":[["I came from the land of Moab.","Ruth 1:4","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Ruth%201%3A4&version=KJV"],["My mother-in-law was Naomi.","Ruth 1:14-16","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Ruth%201%3A14-16&version=KJV"],["I gleaned in the field of Boaz.","Ruth 2:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Ruth%202%3A3&version=KJV"],["I became the great-grandmother of King David.","Ruth 4:17","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Ruth%204%3A17&version=KJV"],["I said, \"Thy people shall be my people, and thy God my God.\"","Ruth 1:16","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Ruth%201%3A16&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Jonah","c":[["I was the son of Amittai.","Jonah 1:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jonah%201%3A1&version=KJV"],["I ran away to Tarshish instead of going where God sent me.","Jonah 1:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jonah%201%3A3&version=KJV"],["The sailors threw me into the sea.","Jonah 1:15","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jonah%201%3A15&version=KJV"],["I preached to Nineveh and the city repented.","Jonah 3:4-5","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jonah%203%3A4-5&version=KJV"],["I was in the belly of a great fish three days and three nights.","Jonah 1:17","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jonah%201%3A17&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Peter","c":[["My brother was Andrew.","Matthew 4:18","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Matthew%204%3A18&version=KJV"],["I walked on the water toward Jesus.","Matthew 14:29","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Matthew%2014%3A29&version=KJV"],["I denied Jesus three times before the cock crew.","Matthew 26:75","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Matthew%2026%3A75&version=KJV"],["I preached on the day of Pentecost.","Acts 2:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%202%3A14&version=KJV"],["Jesus said, \"Upon this rock I will build my church.\"","Matthew 16:18","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Matthew%2016%3A18&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Paul","c":[["I was born in Tarsus.","Acts 22:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2022%3A3&version=KJV"],["I was taught at the feet of Gamaliel.","Acts 22:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2022%3A3&version=KJV"],["I was shipwrecked on the island of Melita.","Acts 28:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2028%3A1&version=KJV"],["I wrote many letters, including Romans and Galatians.","Romans 1:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Romans%201%3A1&version=KJV"],["I met Jesus in a bright light on the road to Damascus.","Acts 9:3-4","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%209%3A3-4&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Mary","c":[["I was from Nazareth, a city of Galilee.","Luke 1:26-27","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%201%3A26-27&version=KJV"],["I was engaged to a man named Joseph.","Luke 1:27","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%201%3A27&version=KJV"],["My cousin Elisabeth was the mother of John the Baptist.","Luke 1:36","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%201%3A36&version=KJV"],["I said, \"Behold the handmaid of the Lord.\"","Luke 1:38","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%201%3A38&version=KJV"],["The angel Gabriel told me I would be the mother of Jesus.","Luke 1:30-31","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%201%3A30-31&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Hannah","c":[["I was one of the two wives of Elkanah.","1 Samuel 1:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%201%3A2&version=KJV"],["I prayed so hard in the temple that Eli thought I was drunk.","1 Samuel 1:13","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%201%3A13&version=KJV"],["I promised to give my son to the LORD.","1 Samuel 1:11","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%201%3A11&version=KJV"],["I made my son a little coat every year.","1 Samuel 2:19","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%202%3A19&version=KJV"],["My son was Samuel the prophet.","1 Samuel 1:20","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%201%3A20&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Samuel","c":[["My mother brought me to Eli at the temple when I was young.","1 Samuel 1:24-25","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%201%3A24-25&version=KJV"],["The LORD called my name in the night.","1 Samuel 3:10","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%203%3A10&version=KJV"],["I said, \"Speak; for thy servant heareth.\"","1 Samuel 3:10","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%203%3A10&version=KJV"],["I anointed Saul as the first king.","1 Samuel 10:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%2010%3A1&version=KJV"],["I anointed David with oil.","1 Samuel 16:13","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Samuel%2016%3A13&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Solomon","c":[["My mother was Bathsheba.","2 Samuel 12:24","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Samuel%2012%3A24&version=KJV"],["I built the temple in Jerusalem.","1 Kings 6:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Kings%206%3A14&version=KJV"],["The queen of Sheba came to test me with hard questions.","1 Kings 10:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Kings%2010%3A1&version=KJV"],["God gave me largeness of heart, even as the sand on the sea shore.","1 Kings 4:29","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1%20Kings%204%3A29&version=KJV"],["I asked God for wisdom.","2 Chronicles 1:10-12","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Chronicles%201%3A10-12&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Jacob","c":[["I held my brother’s heel when we were born.","Genesis 25:26","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Genesis%2025%3A26&version=KJV"],["I dreamed of a ladder reaching to heaven.","Genesis 28:12","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Genesis%2028%3A12&version=KJV"],["I worked fourteen years to marry Rachel.