=KJV"],["I had seven sons and three daughters.","Job 1:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Job%201%3A2&version=KJV"],["I lost my children and my wealth in one day.","Job 1:13-19","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Job%201%3A13-19&version=KJV"],["I said, \"The LORD gave, and the LORD hath taken away.\"","Job 1:21","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Job%201%3A21&version=KJV"],["The LORD gave me twice as much as I had before.","Job 42:10","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Job%2042%3A10&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Isaiah","c":[["I was the son of Amoz.","Isaiah 1:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah%201%3A1&version=KJV"],["I saw the Lord sitting upon a throne, high and lifted up.","Isaiah 6:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah%206%3A1&version=KJV"],["A seraphim touched my lips with a live coal.","Isaiah 6:6-7","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah%206%3A6-7&version=KJV"],["I said, \"Here am I; send me.\"","Isaiah 6:8","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah%206%3A8&version=KJV"],["I prophesied, \"A virgin shall conceive, and bear a son.\"","Isaiah 7:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah%207%3A14&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Jeremiah","c":[["I was of the priests that were in Anathoth.","Jeremiah 1:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jeremiah%201%3A1&version=KJV"],["I said, \"Ah, Lord GOD! behold, I cannot speak: for I am a child.\"","Jeremiah 1:6","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jeremiah%201%3A6&version=KJV"],["I was put into a dungeon and sank in the mire.","Jeremiah 38:6","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jeremiah%2038%3A6&version=KJV"],["I said God’s word was in my heart as a burning fire.","Jeremiah 20:9","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jeremiah%2020%3A9&version=KJV"],["God told me, \"Before I formed thee in the belly I knew thee.\"","Jeremiah 1:5","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Jeremiah%201%3A5&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Nicodemus","c":[["I was a Pharisee and a ruler of the Jews.","John 3:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%203%3A1&version=KJV"],["I came to Jesus by night.","John 3:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%203%3A2&version=KJV"],["Jesus told me I must be born again.","John 3:3-7","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%203%3A3-7&version=KJV"],["I asked, \"How can a man be born when he is old?\"","John 3:4","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%203%3A4&version=KJV"],["I brought myrrh and aloes for the burial of Jesus.","John 19:39","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2019%3A39&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Zacchaeus","c":[["I was chief among the publicans.","Luke 19:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%2019%3A2&version=KJV"],["I was rich.","Luke 19:2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%2019%3A2&version=KJV"],["I was little of stature.","Luke 19:3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%2019%3A3&version=KJV"],["I promised to give half my goods to the poor.","Luke 19:8","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%2019%3A8&version=KJV"],["I climbed a sycomore tree to see Jesus.","Luke 19:4","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Luke%2019%3A4&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Lazarus","c":[["I lived in Bethany.","John 11:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2011%3A1&version=KJV"],["My sisters were Mary and Martha.","John 11:1-2","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2011%3A1-2&version=KJV"],["Jesus wept at my grave.","John 11:35","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2011%3A35&version=KJV"],["I had been dead four days.","John 11:39","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2011%3A39&version=KJV"],["Jesus called me out of the grave with a loud voice.","John 11:43-44","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=John%2011%3A43-44&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Stephen","c":[["I was chosen 