%2018%3A4&version=KJV"],["I spread a threatening letter before the LORD.","2 Kings 19:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%2019%3A14&version=KJV"],["God added fifteen years to my life.","2 Kings 20:6","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%2020%3A6&version=KJV"],["The shadow went back ten degrees on the dial as a sign.","2 Kings 20:11","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%2020%3A11&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Naaman","c":[["I was captain of the host of the king of Syria.","2 Kings 5:1","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%205%3A1&version=KJV"],["A little maid from Israel told my wife about a prophet.","2 Kings 5:2-3","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%205%3A2-3&version=KJV"],["I wanted to wash in Abana and Pharpar instead.","2 Kings 5:12","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%205%3A12&version=KJV"],["My skin came again like the flesh of a little child.","2 Kings 5:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%205%3A14&version=KJV"],["I dipped seven times in the Jordan and was healed of leprosy.","2 Kings 5:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=2%20Kings%205%3A14&version=KJV"]]},{"n":"Lydia","c":[["I was from the city of Thyatira.","Acts 16:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2016%3A14&version=KJV"],["I was a seller of purple.","Acts 16:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2016%3A14&version=KJV"],["I worshipped God by a river side where prayer was made.","Acts 16:13-14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2016%3A13-14&version=KJV"],["The Lord opened my heart to listen to Paul.","Acts 16:14","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2016%3A14&version=KJV"],["I was baptized and asked Paul to stay at my house.","Acts 16:15","https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Acts%2016%3A15&version=KJV"]]}]